+## Keys and roles
+
+Requests carry `Authorization: Bearer <key>`. Keys are in the data as
+`apiKeys: [{ "key", "name", "role" }]`.
+
+- `viewer`: GET only.
+- `cook`: also `POST /recipes/:id/cook`, `POST /batches/:id/waste`,
+  `POST /temperatures` and `POST /stocktakes/:id/counts`.
+- `manager`: everything, including `GET /audit`.
+
+No key or an unknown key is 401 `unauthorized`; a key without permission is
+403 `forbidden`. Each request that changes data by a known key adds an entry
+`{ at, key (the key's name), method, path, status }` to the audit trail,
+listed newest first by `GET /audit`.
+
 ## Errors

 Errors have a status from `src/errors.js` and the body
